   "en": "Forming the nation requires either a Communist Bulgaria to take the focus ⟦0⟧ or a Democratic Bulgaria to take ⟦1⟧. Either will create a faction and unlock decisions to strengthen this respective ideology in all other Balkan Nations with the goal of pressuring them to join into said faction through the focus ⟦2⟧. Upon having at least one other Balkan Nation with the same ideology in the same faction, proceeding down the focus tree will unlock the focus ⟦3⟧, which will grant Bulgaria cores on every Balkan state in Europe (which includes the core states of ⟦4⟧, ⟦5⟧, ⟦6⟧, ⟦7⟧, Edirne and Istanbul), change Bulgaria to a deep black color and will send out an event to every Balkan member of Bulgaria's faction, asking them to unite with Bulgaria. Upon acceptance, their current held territory is transferred to Bulgaria, Bulgaria will gain all units, equipment and military personnel of that nation and Bulgaria will enter all wars the accepting nation was currently in.",
